---
layout: base.njk
og_type: article
---
<style>
/* Article v2: quieter identity, editorial TOC, narrow reading measure */
.series-kicker{margin:0 0 16px;font:700 11px/1.4 Inter,Arial,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.11em;color:var(--muted)}
.series-kicker a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--accent)}
.series-kicker .series-divider{margin:0 7px;color:#b7afa6}
.series-kicker .series-order{color:#6b655f}
.article-header .breadcrumbs{display:none}
.article-header .tag{margin-bottom:14px}
.article-header .article-summary{max-width:850px}
.article-meta{margin-top:18px}
.article-layout{display:block}
.article-body{max-width:none;margin-inline:0}
.article-body>*:not(.article-toc){max-width:none;margin-left:0;margin-right:0}
.article-content-sheet{max-width:794px;margin:0 auto;padding:76px 72px 84px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #ded8d0;box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(43,38,32,.07)}
.article-content-sheet>*:first-child{margin-top:0}
.article-content-sheet>*:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.article-toc{margin:4px 0 42px;border:0;background:#292622;color:#f4efe8}
.article-toc summary{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;min-height:58px;padding:0 22px;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;font:700 11px/1.4 Inter,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f4efe8}
.article-toc summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.article-toc summary::marker{display:none;content:""}
.article-toc summary::after{content:"⌄";font-size:18px;line-height:1;color:#c9bdb1;transition:transform .16s ease}
.article-toc[open] summary::after{transform:rotate(180deg)}
.article-toc nav{padding:0 22px 20px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)}
.article-toc ol{margin:0;padding:8px 0 0;list-style:none;counter-reset:toc}
.article-toc li{margin:0;counter-increment:toc}
.article-toc li+li{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)}
.article-toc a{display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px 1fr;gap:8px;padding:11px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;text-decoration:none;color:#f4efe8}
.article-toc a::before{content:counter(toc,decimal-leading-zero);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#b76b78;padding-top:3px}
.article-toc .toc-level-3 a{padding-left:18px;color:#d8d0c8}
.article-toc summary:focus-visible,.article-toc a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff;outline-offset:2px}
.article-content-sheet table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #bdb7af;margin:26px 0 32px;background:#fff;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45}
.article-content-sheet th,.article-content-sheet td{border:1px solid #c9c3bb;padding:11px 13px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
.article-content-sheet th{background:#ece8e2;font-weight:700}
.article-content-sheet tbody tr:nth-child(even){background:#faf8f5}
.article-body h2[id],.article-body h3[id]{scroll-margin-top:84px}
.series-pager{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.9fr) minmax(0,1.1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:52px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.series-pager a{min-height:132px;padding:20px 22px;border:1px solid var(--line);text-decoration:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;background:var(--paper)}
.series-pager a:hover{border-color:#aaa198}.series-pager .series-pager-label{font:700 10px/1.4 Arial,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.13em;color:var(--muted)}
.series-pager .series-pager-title{font-size:21px;line-height:1.22;margin-top:12px}.series-pager .next{background:var(--dark);color:#fff;border-color:var(--dark)}
.series-pager .next .series-pager-label{color:#cfc8c0}.series-pager .next .series-pager-title{font-size:24px}
.series-pager .prev:only-child{grid-column:1/2}.series-pager .next:only-child{grid-column:2/3}
.cyber-note{margin:34px 0;padding:20px 22px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#f1ece6;font:15px/1.65 Arial,sans-serif}
.cyber-note strong{font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:400}
.related-reading{margin-top:34px}.related-reading ul{margin:12px 0 0;padding-left:20px}.related-reading li{margin:8px 0}.related-reading a{text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:3px}
.article-layout>.sidebar{max-width:820px;margin:52px auto 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}
.article-layout>.sidebar .series-sidebox{display:none}
.article-layout>.sidebar .sidebox{min-width:0}
@media(max-width:950px){.series-pager{grid-template-columns:1fr}.series-pager .next:only-child,.series-pager .prev:only-child{grid-column:auto}.series-pager .next{order:1}.series-pager .prev{order:2}.article-layout>.sidebar{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media(max-width:860px){.article-content-sheet{max-width:none;padding:44px 34px 52px}}\n@media(max-width:620px){.article-content-sheet{padding:30px 20px 38px}.series-kicker{font-size:10px}.series-pager{margin-top:40px}.series-pager a{min-height:112px;padding:17px}.series-pager .series-pager-title,.series-pager .next .series-pager-title{font-size:20px}.article-toc{margin-bottom:30px}.article-toc summary{padding-inline:17px}.article-toc nav{padding:0 17px 16px}.article-toc a{font-size:15px}}
@media(min-width:761px){.article-toc{margin-top:8px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.article-toc summary::after{transition:none}}
</style>
{% set canonicalUrl = canonical or (site.url + page.url) %}
{% set resolvedCategoryUrl = category_url or (category | categoryUrl) %}
{% set relatedArticles = collections.makaleler | relatedByCategory(category, page.url, 3) %}
{% set articleWordCount = content | wordCount %}
{% set articleReadingTime = content | readingTime %}
{% set articleToc = content | legalToc %}
{% if series_id and series[series_id] %}
  {% set currentSeries = series[series_id] %}
  {% if series_order > 1 %}{% set seriesPrev = currentSeries.items[series_order - 2] %}{% endif %}
  {% if series_order < currentSeries.items.length %}{% set seriesNext = currentSeries.items[series_order] %}{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% set articleReviewDate = legal_review_date or legalReviewDate %}
{% set articleAboutThings = (about or legal_about or statutes) | schemaThings %}
{% set articleCitations = (citations or citation or precedents) | schemaCitations %}
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Article","@id":{{ (canonicalUrl + '#article') | json }},"headline":{{ title | json }},"description":{{ (description or summary) | json }},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":{{ canonicalUrl | json }}},"author":{"@id":"https://ozanferhatsen.com.tr/#ozan-ferhat-sen"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://ozanferhatsen.com.tr/#ozan-ferhat-sen"},"isPartOf":[{"@id":"https://ozanferhatsen.com.tr/#website"}{% if currentSeries %},{"@type":"CollectionPage","name":{{ currentSeries.title | json }},"url":{{ (site.url + currentSeries.url) | json }}}{% endif %}],"datePublished":{{ date | isoDate | json }},"dateModified":{{ (updated or date) | isoDate | json }},{% if articleReviewDate %}"lastReviewed":{{ articleReviewDate | isoDate | json }},{% endif %}"inLanguage":"tr-TR","articleSection":{{ category | json }}{% if image %},"image":{{ (site.url + image) | json }}{% endif %}{% if articleAboutThings and articleAboutThings.length %},"about":{{ articleAboutThings | json }}{% endif %}{% if articleCitations and articleCitations.length %},"citation":{{ articleCitations | json }}{% endif %}},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":{{ (canonicalUrl + '#breadcrumb') | json }},"itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Ana Sayfa","item":"https://ozanferhatsen.com.tr/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":{{ category | json }},"item":{{ (site.url + resolvedCategoryUrl) | json }}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":{{ title | json }},"item":{{ canonicalUrl | json }}}]}]}</script>
<section class="article-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="breadcrumbs" aria-hidden="true"><a href="/">Ana Sayfa</a> / <a href="{{ resolvedCategoryUrl }}">{{ category }}</a> / {{ title }}</div>
    {% if currentSeries %}
    <div class="series-kicker"><a href="{{ resolvedCategoryUrl }}">{{ category }}</a><span class="series-divider">·</span><a href="{{ currentSeries.url }}">{{ currentSeries.title }}</a><span class="series-divider">·</span><span class="series-order">{{ series_order }}/{{ currentSeries.items.length }}</span></div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="tag">{{ category }}</div>
    {% endif %}
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    <p class="article-summary">{{ summary }}</p>
    <div class="article-meta" data-word-count="{{ articleWordCount }}">{{ articleReadingTime }} dk okuma{% if articleReviewDate %} · Hukuki kontrol: {{ articleReviewDate | dateTR }}{% endif %}</div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="wrap article-layout">
  <article class="article-body">
    {% if articleToc.length >= 3 %}
    <details class="article-toc">
      <summary>Bu yazıda</summary>
      <nav aria-label="Makale içindekiler">
        <ol>
          {% for item in articleToc %}
          <li class="toc-level-{{ item.level }}"><a href="#{{ item.id }}">{{ item.text }}</a></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ol>
      </nav>
    </details>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="article-content-sheet">
    {% if image %}<p><img src="{{ image }}" alt="{{ image_alt or title }}" loading="eager" decoding="async" style="width:100%;height:auto"></p>{% endif %}
    {{ content | safe }}

    {% if page.url == '/makaleler/yargitay-hukuk-genel-kurulu-kararlari-tasinmaz-satisindan-dogan-uyusmazliklar/' %}
      {% include "hgk-tasinmaz-final-redaksiyon.njk" %}
    {% endif %}

    </div>

    {% if sources %}
    <section class="author-box"><h2>Kaynaklar ve hukuki dayanak</h2><ul>{% for source in sources %}<li>{% if source.url %}<a href="{{ source.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ source.name | sourceAttribution }}</a>{% else %}{{ source.name | sourceAttribution }}{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></section>
    {% endif %}

    {% if relatedArticles.length %}
    <section class="author-box related-reading" aria-label="İlgili makaleler"><h2>İlgili makaleler</h2><ul>{% for article in relatedArticles %}<li><a href="{{ article.url }}">{{ article.data.title }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul></section>
    {% endif %}

    {% if currentSeries and ((seriesPrev and seriesPrev.url) or (seriesNext and seriesNext.url)) %}
    <nav class="series-pager" aria-label="Makale serisi bölümleri">
      {% if seriesPrev and seriesPrev.url %}
      <a class="prev" href="{{ seriesPrev.url }}">
        <span class="series-pager-label">← Önceki bölüm</span>
        <span class="series-pager-title">{{ seriesPrev.title }}</span>
      </a>
      {% endif %}
      {% if seriesNext and seriesNext.url %}
      <a class="next" href="{{ seriesNext.url }}">
        <span class="series-pager-label">Sıradaki bölüm →</span>
        <span class="series-pager-title">{{ seriesNext.title }}</span>
      </a>
      {% endif %}
    </nav>
    {% endif %}

    {% if category == 'Bilişim Hukuku' %}
    <div class="cta-box"><h2>Dijital dosyalarda tek kayıt bütün resmi göstermez</h2><p>NCMEC raporu, hesap ve platform kayıtları, IP/port verileri, cihaz incelemesi ve bilirkişi raporları somut olayın zaman çizelgesi içinde birlikte değerlendirilmelidir.</p><p><a class="btn primary" href="/iletisim/">İletişim</a></p></div>
    <div class="author-box"><h2>Av. Ozan Ferhat Şen</h2><p>Bu içerik; yürürlükteki mevzuat, yargı kararları, akademik kaynaklar ve dijital delilin teknik özellikleri birlikte değerlendirilerek genel hukuki bilgilendirme amacıyla hazırlanmıştır.</p><p><a href="/hakkimda/">Hakkımda →</a></p></div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="cta-box"><h2>Somut olayın belgeleri ayrı değerlendirilir</h2><p>İmar, kentsel dönüşüm, inşaat ve gayrimenkul uyuşmazlıklarında hukuki sonuç çoğu zaman tapu kayıtları, sözleşme, imar planı, belediye işlemleri ve dosyaya özgü tarihler birlikte incelendiğinde ortaya çıkar.</p><p><a class="btn primary" href="/iletisim/">İletişim</a></p></div>
    <div class="author-box"><h2>Av. Ozan Ferhat Şen</h2><p>Gayrimenkul, inşaat ve imar hukukuna ilişkin mesleki çalışmalarını, İstanbul Üniversitesi Sosyal Bilimler Enstitüsü Gayrimenkul ve İnşaat Hukuku Yüksek Lisans Programında aldığı derslerle akademik olarak derinleştirmiştir.</p><p><a href="/hakkimda/">Hakkımda →</a></p></div>
    {% endif %}
  </article>

  <aside class="sidebar">
    {% if currentSeries %}
    <div class="sidebox series-sidebox">
      <div class="series-label">Okuma sırası</div>
      <h3><a href="{{ currentSeries.url }}">{{ currentSeries.title }}</a></h3>
      <ol class="series-list">
        {% for item in currentSeries.items %}
        <li{% if item.order == series_order %} class="is-current"{% endif %}>
          {% if item.url %}
          <a href="{{ item.url }}"><span class="series-num">{% if item.order < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ item.order }}</span><span>{{ item.title }}</span></a>
          {% else %}
          <div class="series-planned"><span class="series-num">{% if item.order < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ item.order }}</span><span class="series-planned-text"><span>{{ item.title }}</span><span class="series-planned-badge">Hazırlanıyor</span></span></div>
          {% endif %}
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="sidebox"><h3>İlgili çalışma alanı</h3><p><a href="{{ resolvedCategoryUrl }}">{{ category }}</a></p></div>
    <div class="sidebox"><h3>Hızlı iletişim</h3><p><a href="{{ site.whatsapp }}">WhatsApp</a><br><a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a></p></div>
    <div class="sidebox"><h3>Bilgilendirme</h3><p class="legal-note">Bu içerik genel hukuki bilgilendirme amacı taşır. Somut olayın belgeleri ve özel koşulları ayrıca değerlendirilmelidir.</p></div>
  </aside>
</section>
